Source: https://sjp.pl/

It is a simple game based on PIG from RS Games containing several differences, which are described below:
First of all, instead of six, the die has eight sides.
1 loses all points collected so far and ends the turn;
2 is automatically added to the bank, but the same player may continue playing;
7 is Head (the cat's head), which does absolutely nothing;
8 is tail (the cat's tail), which randomly adds or subtracts 8 points.
The target score is selected when creating the table; the default is 100.
After the last player's turn in the round ends, the highest score wins. If several players have the same highest score, the game ends in a draw.
